    "title": "Context crosses an ingress policy",
    "caption": "The gateway validates the client carrier and chooses accepted or re-rooted server context. Backend spans follow that decision; client and server exports are not guaranteed to share one trace after re-rooting. Export arrows show logical delivery, not a delivery-time guarantee.",
